-US","text":"Where is the bookshop?"},"skillIds":["reading","u10.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"choices":[{"id":"c1","text":"We do not know."},{"id":"c2","text":"No, it is near."},{"id":"c3","text":"Yes, it is very far."}],"passage":"On Saturday, Tom wants to go to the bookshop. He walks from his house, but the city is big and he is lost. He does not have a map. He asks a woman, \"Excuse me, where is the bookshop?\" \"Go straight on this street. Turn left at the bank. The bookshop is next to the park, opposite the hospital.\" \"Is it far?\" \"No, it is near. You can walk.\" Tom finds the bookshop. Mai is there too! \"You are not lost now,\" she laughs.","question":"Is the bookshop far?"},"explanation":"Đáp án: \"No, it is near.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctChoiceId":"c2","ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"Đọc lại câu chuyện \"Tom bị lạc\".","id":"u10n4l2-e02","prompt":{"locale":"en-US","text":"Is the bookshop far?"},"skillIds":["reading","u10.story"],"type":"storyQuestion","vocabularyIds":[]},{"content":{"tokens":[{"id":"t1","text":"ở"},{"id":"t2","text":"Cửa"},{"id":"t3","text":"năm"},{"id":"t4","text":"có"},{"id":"t5","text":"đường"},{"id":"t6","text":"trái"},{"id":"t7","text":"góc"},{"id":"t8","text":"Chúc"},{"id":"t9","text":"hàng"}]},"explanation":"Câu đúng: \"Cửa hàng ở góc đường.\".","gradingRule":{"caseSensitive":false,"correctTokenIds":["t2","t9","t1","t7","t5"],"ignoreDiacritics":false,"ignorePunctuation":false},"hint":"\"shop\" = cửa hàng; \"corner\" = góc đường","id":"u10n4l2-e03","prompt":{"locale":"vi-VN","text":"Dịch sang tiếng Việt: \"The shop is on the corner.\""},"skillIds":["u10.grammar"],"type":"wordBank","vocabularyIds":["u9.shop","u10.corner"]},{"content":{"locale":"en-US","maxSeconds":12,"referenceText":"It is next to the park."},"explanation":"Câu trả lời mẫu: \"It is next to the park.\". Cũng đúng: \"Next to the park.\", \"It's next to the park.\".","gradingRule":{